# Cloudflare Pages header rules (see HARDWARE_TESTING.md §5).
#
# The app is a small static site (Cloudflare Pages caps a single file at 25 MiB),
# so the model + WASM binaries are NOT served from here — they live on R2 and the
# service worker (public/sw.js) proxies them through as same-origin responses.
# The rules below therefore cover only the app shell.

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

# The service worker itself must never be cached, or clients get stuck on an
# old cache version.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

# The worker script is content-addressed by deploy; revalidate so an update is
# picked up without waiting out a long TTL.
/inference-worker.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
